#: processes/sdlc/requirements-filing.bpmn:76
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Never delete (`git rm`) a superseded or retired requirement. When superseding `req:<old-slug>`, set `status: superseded` and `supersededBy: req:<new-slug>` on `docs/requirements/<old-slug>.md`. When retiring, set `status: retired` and document the retirement reason and authorising issue in prose. Update any `RequirementSet` (`docs/requirements/*.set.json`) so approved/accepted sets hold only `in-force` members."
msgstr ""

