#: processes/sdlc/requirements-filing.bpmn:122
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Routes on the recorded `requirement-signoff` outcome from `BA_ReviewFiling`: `approve` or `amend` completes the filing; `reject`, `defer`, or `cancel` holds the filing with its recorded reason."
msgstr ""

#: processes/sdlc/requirements-filing.bpmn:90
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Run `bun run cat check:requirements` to verify schema conformance (`bootstrap/schemas/requirement.schema.json`), slug uniqueness across `docs/proposals/` and `docs/requirements/`, acyclicity of `derivedFrom`, existence of all referenced `derivedFrom` / `dependsOn` / `supersededBy` / `skills` / `processes` targets, and `RequirementSet` sign-off invariants."
msgstr ""

